 flux2-vae_small.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [580, 630], "pos": [-2493.333740234375, -649.7980346679688], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "links": [], "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "links": [], "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [626.1590576171875, 1015.7041015625], "pos": [3588.486083984375, -419.3711242675781], "widgets_values": ["moss_root_example"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 109, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [110], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [440, 580], "pos": [949.4498901367188, -596.554443359375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 71, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}], "flags": {}, "id": 37, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Layout / bounding-box flow\n\n`CreateBoundingBoxes` is where the layout is drawn: it outputs the boxes as `BOUNDING_BOX` plus an element list → `MOSS-Image Layout Prompt` turns those elements into the Layout prompt → that `prompt` is wired into `positive_prompt` of the **Text to Image (MOSS-Image)** subgraph. Remove the link to fall back to a plain text prompt.\n\nPrompt upsampler is **on** in this template, so it can rewrite the prompt and drop the layout — set `enable_prompt_upsampler` to `false` (inside the subgraph) when the boxes must survive verbatim."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [420, 240], "pos": [983.385009765625, 101.55635070800781], "id": 35, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [71], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "size": [592.6282348632812, 730.73974609375], "pos": [303.10223388671875, -590.6951904296875], "widgets_values": ["Create a realistic Vogue magazine cover–style fashion portrait using the uploaded face as the original face reference (100% face identity preservation).\n\nA young elegant woman posing confidently, maintaining her original facial features and natural beauty. She is winking with her left eye and making a playful duck-face expression. Both hands are raised, forming a love/heart gesture near her face.\n\nShe is surrounded by multiple DSLR cameras and smartphones held around her, as if paparazzi and photographers are capturing her from all directions. Some phones show her live image on their screens.\n\nAppearance & styling: flawless glowing skin, natural makeup with glossy pink lips, soft blush, subtle highlights. Light brown hair styled in a low, neat updo with a few loose strands.\n\nOutfit & accessories: elegant minimalist beige-white strapless evening dress, Louis Vuitton necklace, diamond ring, luxury fashion jewelry.\n\nPhotography style: close-up to half-body fashion portrait, Vogue editorial aesthetic, cinematic professional studio lighting, soft HDR background, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, ultra-detailed, 8K quality.\n\nCamera & lens look: professional DSLR look, 85mm lens feel, f/1.8 aperture, crisp focus with smooth background bokeh.\n\nComposition: Vogue magazine layout with large bold logo at the top, editorial fashion cover framing, clean and elegant design.\n\nMood & vibe: playful yet luxurious, high-fashion beauty editorial, realistic, not AI-looking, photographed by a professional fashion photographer.", 1024, 1024, "1"], "inputs": [{"name": "element", "link": 72, "label": "element", "type": "ARRAY", "localized_name": "element"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 69, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 70, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "character_boxes"}, "name": "character_boxes", "label": "character_boxes", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "character_boxes"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "MOSSImageLayoutPrompt", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MOSSImageLayoutPrompt"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MOSS-Image capabilities and limits\n\nSources: [USERGUIDE](https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/USERGUIDE.md), README, HF Base/SFT cards; cross-checked against community benchmark notes.\n\n### Resolution\n\n| Item | Official |\n|------|----------|\n| Recommended total pixels | **1M, 1.5M, or 2M** |\n| Extrapolation range | **0.25M (512×512) to 4M (~2K)** |\n| Aspect ratio | Arbitrary; width/height must be positive multiples of **16** |\n| This template default | 1024×1024 (~1M) |\n\n### Strengths\n\n- ~**5B** single-stream DiT (Muon); FLUX.2 small VAE; Qwen-family text encoder.\n- Strong bilingual English and Chinese text rendering and auto layout; JSON Layout control for text/objects; long prompts (~**4K** tokens); anime and photorealistic.\n- **SFT** clearer text grouping/layouts; **Base** has no post-training / CFG distillation (better for community LoRAs).\n- Inputs: natural language, tag sequences, JSON layout (layout is experimental). Prefer English (most training data); Chinese supported.\n\n### Limits / notes\n\n- Auto line breaks may not match intent — use `\\n` or real newlines for precise text.\n- Turning off SLG looks more realistic but can collapse details; official negative-branch skip layer **22** (24/26 also help). kijai notes SLG can overblow anime styles.\n- Recommended negative prompt: `nsfw, worst quality, bad anatomy, watermark, jpeg artifact`\n- If VRAM is tight, lower resolution or use Sequential / CPU offload.\n- When training LoRA yourself, **freeze the text encoder**.\n- License: Apache 2.0.\n\n---\n\n## Sampling settings vs. official defaults\n\n| Setting | This template | OpenMOSS official |\n|---------|---------------|-------------------|\n| Steps | 25 | 50 |\n| CFG | 2.5 | 3 |\n| Sampler | er_sde | Euler |\n| Scheduler | simple | default |\n| Denoise | 1 | 1 |\n| Shift | 5 (model default) | 5 (same) |\n\nThis template follows the faster settings from kijai's ComfyUI MOSS-Image PR [#17095](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/pull/17095). That is a speed trade-off, not a bug. For results closer to the official ones, try 50 steps and CFG 3.\n\n### Community notes\n\n- **Skip layer guidance:** can overblow anime styles; no alternative values were suggested (template keeps official layer 22). You can check the detail settings inside the subgraph\n- **Shift:** adjust with ModelSamplingAuraFlow or ModelSamplingFlux — ModelSamplingSD3 uses a completely different scale. You can enter the subgraph to adjust it\n- **SFT banding:** experimental LoRA at about −0.5 strength: [moss_image_sft_lora_blocks_21_to_49…](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MOSS-image_experimental/blob/main/loras/moss_image_sft_lora_blocks_21_to_49_rank_512_bf16.safetensors)\n\n\n## Prompt skill\n\nThe system prompt driving the upsampler is written from the official [MOSS-Image Prompt Enhancer skill](https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer/SKILL.md). The same skill turns an idea into a caption or a Layout prompt outside ComfyUI, and it is the reference for the caption style this model was trained on."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 1200], "pos": [-1883.3331298828125, -649.7980346679688], "id": 29, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [89], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [340, 110], "pos": [1601.769775390625, 603.8439331054688], "widgets_values": [false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "on_false", "link": 128, "label": "on_false", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "on_true", "link": 90, "label": "on_true", "type": "*", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [90], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [350, 210], "pos": [1600.7154541015625, 329.66265869140625], "widgets_values": ["", "22", 0, 0.5], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 127, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "double_layers"}, "na